cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GEMs, please cite it as below."
title: "GEMs — GYNOID ENTITY MODELS"
abstract: >-
  Open-source designs for a physical humanoid body built to acquire physical
  experience on behalf of a controller that does not live entirely on it. A
  platform specification: it declares capability envelopes and the trade-offs
  between them, and leaves the operating point to whoever runs the body.
type: software
